OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AStifling heat and broken toilets: TUI
OL,4,ARiver Cruise passengers tell of their
OL,5,Aholiday hell
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing that report more people got
OL,8,Fin touch to say they faced similar
OL,9,Fproblems on both the Skyla and its
OL,10,Fsister vessel, the Isla. They
OL,11,Fcriticised TUI's customer service and
OL,12,Fsaid the refunds offered were
OL,13,Finadequate.
OL,15,FTUI apologised to customers where trips
OL,16,F"fell short of the standards we aim to
OL,17,Fdeliver".
